From a945ae776b6b92d8fda9d450e7ee1c846f6da69c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roins-hub <2676353587@qq.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 20:45:40 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] feat(chat): run inside the Mote workspace at
 vip.tangzhi.org/chat
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Build-time mode (NEXT_PUBLIC_CHAT_MODE=mote, NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_PATH=/chat):
- uses the workspace's API key and relay URL from the same origin, no
  separate key entry;
- chat history is stored on the workspace server (/api/chat-store, per
  relay account) instead of IndexedDB; export / import / clear work on
  the account, and old backups import as-is;
- colours follow the workspace theme (paper / celadon / mist / graphite /
  midnight); header and sidebar link back to the video / image workspace;
- the /生图 tool opens the workspace with an image model and the prompt
  filled in.

The standalone build (chat.tangzhi.org) keeps local storage and shows a
notice pointing to the new address (NEXT_PUBLIC_MIGRATE_URL).
docker-compose builds both: sub2image-chat (13002) and mote-chat (13003).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
